  "prediction": "The report provides essential resources for congressional staff seeking to understand legislative procedures and processes. The report recommends visiting the House and Senate \"Legislative Process\" websites for official overviews and explanatory information. Additionally, several key publications are listed, including the House Rules and Manual, House Practice: A Guide to the Rules, Procedures in the U.S. Senate, and Riddick's Senate Manual. These publications offer comprehensive information on the rules, procedures, and precedents of the House and Senate. The Office of the Senate and the House Parliamentarians distribute copies to congressional offices, while some publications are available online through the Government Publishing Office (GPO) website. CRS, a congressional research service, also offers a variety of resources and services on legislative procedure, including reports, videos, and a glossary available to the public on its website. CRS also offers customized research and briefings for congressional staff. Overall, the report emphasizes the importance of familiarizing oneself with these resources to effectively navigate the legislative process.",
  "scored_prediction": "The report provides essential resources for congressional staff seeking to understand legislative procedures and processes. The report recommends visiting the House and Senate \"Legislative Process\" websites for official overviews and explanatory information. Additionally, several key publications are listed, including the House Rules and Manual, House Practice: A Guide to the Rules, Procedures in the U.S. Senate, and Riddick's Senate Manual. These publications offer comprehensive information on the rules, procedures, and precedents of the House and Senate. The Office of the Senate and the House Parliamentarians distribute copies to congressional offices, while some publications are available online through the Government Publishing Office (GPO) website. CRS, a congressional research service, also offers a variety of resources and services on legislative procedure, including reports, videos, and a glossary available to the public on its website. CRS also offers customized research and briefings for congressional staff. Overall, the report emphasizes the importance of familiarizing oneself with these resources to effectively navigate the legislative process.",
  "score": 29.999999568979597,
  "answers": [
    "Written for congressional staff, this report identifies and provides details on how to obtain information on legislative procedures and process in the House and Senate. It provides references to selected CRS products and offers information on the CRS legislative institutes. A listing of selected supplementary materials is also provided. This report will be updated as new information is available."
